The 2024 Volkswagen Touareg V6 TSI eHybrid is a plug-in hybrid variant of the facelifted third-generation Touareg. It combines a 3.0-litre turbocharged V6 petrol engine with an electric motor. There are two versions: the standard eHybrid and the higher-output R eHybrid. This evaluation focuses on the standard eHybrid unless specified.

